{"reviews":[{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-0","r":5.0,"t":"MUST READ THIS REVIEW!!!!","x":"I am going to try and make this review short and to the point. I got this wig in two days. Took it out the box and put it on, a hot mess but it fit. Not too big. Not too small. Then, I sprayed it with a little water and the magic started to happen...lol. This here is the best wig yet! I have never ordered a wig less than $90. The price is right. Let me tell you, I took this wig off. Rinsed and conditioned it. It did not shed. It did not tangle. I let it air dry, so soft . Very, very nice. And th","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Best purchase","x":"This item was a great purchase! I wasn't sure how it would look or feel but it superceded my expectations and I've received so many compliments! It's very soft you can part it on either side. I'll be purchasing another soon.","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing deal and quality","x":"Very impressed..good price and great quality.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-3","r":4.0,"t":"The price was right","x":"I was really surprise this wig is very cute I really like it easy maintain wet it a little curls right up .","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-4","r":1.0,"t":"Excellent work wig!","x":"Very soft but .... THESE ARE THE JERY CURLS FROM THE 80\u2019s I\u2019m not feeling that but ....Yes it\u2019s definitely a great work wig from 5am to 9 pm not too tight just comfortable....not high maintenance excellent! When U up at 4 am \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udfff\ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udcaf","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-5","r":1.0,"t":"Isn\u2019t a lace front wig","x":"This is a closure wig , this isn\u2019t a lace front wig like the seller makes it seem like please don\u2019t purchase","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Make sure you use moose amd water and it will be mega curly.","x":"I love this lil wig! Its easy to manage and i can definitely slap it on and go.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-7","r":5.0,"t":"its awesome ready to go","x":"My self it fits and looks really natural","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-8","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful hair, but needs some work on construction.","x":"Love the texture and curl pattern of the hair. It would get 5 stars from me if the hair was the same length throughout the wig like it is on top, which would make it easier to customize. Because the hair is so short around the hairline 3\" and it's cut to the shape of cap, I had to go through and add hair to reshape it for coverage around my ears. The cap also runs large. It sits down on my ears.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-9","r":1.0,"t":"False sizing. 4 inches not 6 inches","x":"DEFINITELY NOT 6 inches  long. About 4 inches or shorter. I ordered thinking it was 6 inches and was in for a rude awakening. It put me between a rock and a hard space, because I needed for an event and once I tried it on and trimmed it to my head, I immediately noticed it wasn\u2019t the correct size of length. It was shorter. Very disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-10","r":5.0,"t":"\u2764\ufe0f\u2764\ufe0f","x":"I love the wig! It\u2019s full and thick! I\u2019ve gotten lots of compliments. It\u2019s about to be one of my go to wigs.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Elegant","x":"I love the look and feel of this wig. Light weight and it wasn\u2019t to hot on my head...","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-12","r":3.0,"t":"More kinky curly","x":"This was fairly a neat unit, however the texture was more kinky curly.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-13","r":1.0,"t":"Poor quality","x":"The hair was more of a synthetic blend. Not Brazilian.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Good","x":"Great wig and quality is good. Easy to style!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Extremely happy customer","x":"Certain things I typically will not purchase online and wigs are one of those things. Saw the wig online couldn\u2019t find it in stores so I ordered and ladies let me tell you something this wig gives me LIFE! It\u2019s soft, the curls are full and thick. I love the natural color but plan to order a second one to bleach and have fun with changing the color for the summer. It lightweight and very very comfortable. If you\u2019re thinking about ordering trust me when I say DO IT!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-16","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect everyday wig","x":"This wig is grea, if you want a super natural density and look buy this wig! If you want super thick and glam this may nit be tye right product for you. This is tge perfect everyday wig and although its only a 4x4 lace it still feels super secure and thats coming from someone with a shaved head!  Also if you want to be my first product deal for my youtube e channel I'd be excited to work with you.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-17","r":1.0,"t":"Deceiving model picture. The wig is not the same as pictured.","x":"Worse wig for me, the model wig looks beautiful and you purchase it and when it arrived, it is a totally different wig you are looking at. The picture is deceiving,the one I saw when I got home from work that night looks horrible, didn't even try it on,it even look as though someone was wearing it already. I put it back in the package and sent it back the next day.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-18","r":4.0,"t":"Love the Wig but not the Texture","x":"Love the wig as far as the color and the style.  The only thing, it is not curly as displayed, it is more kinky.  If it was more curly, I would say I have found what I am looking for and would have ordered another one.  Wig not bad other than not being curly. If yo are looking  for somewhat kinky, this is the one.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-19","r":1.0,"t":"Do not buy this wig \u201cTRUST ME\u201d","x":"This wig looked horrible didn\u2019t even look like a curly wig, once I put a little water and wig product on it the curl pattern was so small and tight it looked like a poodle I hate it never again will I purchase from this company. I still can\u2019t believe I paid 50 something dollars for this wig.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-20","r":1.0,"t":"Not human hair","x":"I received this wig and it was a hot mess. It felt rough and it is not human hair. A waist of money. I have no clue what I am going to do with this thing. It came with 2 inches of lace across the top. I should have returned it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-21","r":1.0,"t":"Terrible Wigs","x":"Returned it because was misrepresented to be a half lace front wig.  It looked like someone tried out making a wig and failed. Terrible looking hair texture. My children were laughing and trying to show it to their friends!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful beautiful hair","x":"Beautiful beautiful hair. Its just perfect. Extremely natural looking, lots of compliments and people assuming it's my real hair. Love it and would order again,The package even sent a pack of wig caps as a gift!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-23","r":1.0,"t":"Total disappointment!!","x":"Did not receive  the wig in the picture...Lace was a closure not a frontal and barely see-thru. Hair felt synthetic. When I tried to return it the link was a different picture of a another wig. Straight fraud","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08D9FYDLJ-24","r":1.0,"t":"It's nothing like the pictures.","x":"[[VIDEOID:33a3289186e9e004f66df9d9c469b15d]] It doesn't fit my head and I have a small head and the lace is just a little strip, Very unsatisfied. I was gonna wear it for Easter and my spring break vacation.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Customers frequently praise the wig as soft, easy to manage, and quick to put on and go.","cites":[2,4,5,7,8]},{"text":"Many reviewers love the look and feel, reporting compliments and a natural appearance.","cites":[2,8,11,12]},{"text":"Several customers consider it a great value with good quality for the price.","cites":[3,4,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the hair is shorter than advertised or uneven in length, requiring customization.","cites":[9,10]},{"text":"A few customers complain about misrepresentation, including it not being a true lace front and the hair being a synthetic blend rather than Brazilian.","cites":[6,14]}]},"qa":[]}